sequenceDiagram
  actor Admin
  participant AssembliesController
  participant AssemblyService
  participant AssemblyRepo
  participant NotificationRepo
  participant Dispatch as NotificationDispatchService

  Admin->>AssembliesController: POST /assemblies
  AssembliesController->>AssemblyService: CreateAsync(request)
  AssemblyService->>AssemblyRepo: Add assembly (Scheduled)
  AssemblyService->>NotificationRepo: Add condominium notification
  AssemblyService->>Dispatch: DispatchAsync(notification, external=true)
  AssemblyService-->>AssembliesController: AssemblyDto
  AssembliesController-->>Admin: 201 Created

  Admin->>AssembliesController: PUT /assemblies/{id}/minutes
  AssembliesController->>AssemblyService: UpdateMinutesAsync(...)
  AssemblyService->>AssemblyRepo: Update status Completed + minutes
  AssemblyService->>NotificationRepo: Add completion notification
  AssemblyService->>Dispatch: DispatchAsync(notification, external=false)
  AssemblyService-->>AssembliesController: AssemblyDto
  AssembliesController-->>Admin: 200 OK
